# Update Agent Pipeline Registry

When you change any file matched by this rule, also update [AGENT_PIPELINE_REGISTRY.md](/home/bhard/.openclaw/AGENT_PIPELINE_REGISTRY.md) in the same task.

## Checklist

1. Bump the **Last updated** date at the top of the registry.
2. Append one line to the **Change log** table describing what changed.
3. Update only the affected sections (agent profile, tools table, skills list, spawn message, pipeline step, etc.). Do not rewrite unrelated sections.
4. Never copy secrets (tokens, passwords, API keys) into the registry. Document locations only (`TOOLS.md`, `openclaw.json`).

## What to update per change type

| Change | Registry sections to edit |
|--------|---------------------------|
| `openclaw.json` agent/model/tools | Global config, Agent registry matrix, per-agent tools |
| `SOUL.md` | Per-agent profile, spawn messages, pipeline steps |
| `AGENTS.md` / `IDENTITY.md` | Per-agent profile (if role/rules changed) |
| `COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md` | Writer profile, editorial rules summary |
| New/removed skill or pipeline script | Skills inventory, Orchestrator pipeline scripts table |
| `TOOLS.md` | Per-agent profile (note config location only, no secrets) |
